<h3 class="fadeInUp animatable"><%= department.name %></h3>
<p class="fadeInUp animatable">At our Paediatric Medicine Department, we provide comprehensive, evidence-based care for infants, children, and adolescents across the full spectrum of general and complex medical conditions. With a dedicated team of paediatricians, nurses, and allied specialists, we offer accurate diagnosis, compassionate treatment, and coordinated follow-up, ensuring every child receives holistic care in a safe and supportive environment.</p>
<p class="pt-4 fadeInUp animatable">Our Specialised Services Include:</p>
<div class="workup-sec mt-3">
<h4 class="py-3 fadeInUp animatable">Diagnostic Work Up</h4>
<ul class="listing-apps">
<li class="fadeInUp animatable first_class">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Comprehensive Clinical Evaluation</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Detailed history-taking, physical examination, developmental assessment, and growth monitoring to identify acute illnesses or underlying chronic conditions.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Laboratory Investigations</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Complete blood counts, infection markers, metabolic panels, liver and renal function tests, allergy screening, and other targeted investigations based on clinical needs.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div>
<h5>Imaging and Radiological Assessment</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Access to child-friendly diagnostic services, including X-rays, ultrasound, CT and MRI, enabling timely and accurate evaluation of medical concerns.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Developmental and Nutritional Assessment</h5>
</div>
<p>Evaluation of growth patterns, nutritional deficiencies, developmental milestones, and early warning signs of childhood disorders.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 class="py-3 mt-4 fadeInUp animatable">Interventional and Advanced Management</h4>
<ul class="listing-apps">
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Management of Acute Paediatric Illnesses</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Immediate assessment and treatment of common and complex acute conditions including respiratory infections, gastroenteritis, dehydration, febrile illnesses, asthma exacerbations, and allergic reactions.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div>
<h5>Chronic Disease Management</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Long-term care for conditions such as asthma, epilepsy (in liaison with neurology), allergies, anaemia, recurrent infections, and nutritional or gastrointestinal disorders.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable speciality_banner_no"><img class="img-fluid speciality_banner" src="/upload/fileManager/specialise_banner/PaediatricMedicine.png"></li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Immunisation Services</h5>
</div>
<p>Comprehensive vaccinations as per national and international schedules, along with catch-up programmes, travel immunisations, and parental counselling.</p>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Neonatal and Infant Care</h5>
</div>
<p>Specialised care for newborns and young infants, including feeding support, management of jaundice, newborn screening interpretation, and early developmental monitoring.</p>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Emergency Paediatric Care</h5>
</div>
<p>Rapid stabilisation and treatment of critical conditions such as severe infections, respiratory distress, seizures, trauma, and acute allergic reactions.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 class="py-3 mt-4 fadeInUp animatable">Medical Management and Specialised Clinics</h4>
<ul class="listing-apps">
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Paediatric Allergy and Asthma Clinic</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Diagnosis and management of asthma, allergic rhinitis, eczema, food allergies, and environmental allergies, with long-term treatment plans.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Nutrition, Growth and Anaemia Clinic</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Evaluation of failure to thrive, childhood obesity, anaemia, micronutrient deficiencies, and feeding difficulties, supported by paediatric dieticians.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Infectious Diseases Clinic</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Management of recurrent infections, prolonged fever, tropical infections, and post-infection complications, with guidance on prevention and immunity.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Adolescent Medicine Clinic</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Specialised care tailored for teenagers, focusing on growth concerns, menstrual issues, acne, mental health, stress, sleep disorders, and lifestyle counselling.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Developmental and Behavioural Clinic</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Assessment and support for developmental delays, behavioural challenges, school difficulties, learning issues, and early recognition of neurodevelopmental disorders.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Gastroenterology and Hepatology Support</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Evaluation of chronic abdominal pain, constipation, reflux, coeliac disease, liver disorders, and other gastrointestinal concerns.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Immunology and Rheumatology Support</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Care for children with autoimmune conditions, recurrent fevers, joint pains, and suspected immunodeficiency disorders.</p>
</div>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 class="py-3 mt-4 fadeInUp animated">Preventive Care, Follow-Up and Family Support</h4>
<p class="fadeInUp animated">We believe in the power of preventive paediatrics. Our team provides:</p>
<ul>
<li>Regular growth and health check-ups</li>
<li>Developmental milestone monitoring</li>
<li>Nutritional guidance</li>
<li>School readiness and behavioural support</li>
<li>Counselling for parents on sleep, feeding, behaviour, immunity, and safety</li>
</ul>
<p class="fadeInUp animated">We also offer structured follow-up programmes to ensure the child’s full recovery, optimal growth, and continued well-being, with smooth transition to speciality care whenever required.</p>
</div>
<div class="mt-5 fadeInUp animatable">
<h4>We have dedicated clinic for</h4>
</div>
